16 a1  3.5 0.58
20 f1  3.5 0.56
24 g1  3.5 0.58
28 c2  2   0.56
30 g1  2   0.5
# --- hook: pergunta igual, resposta que abre e termina no G do loop ---
track kal kalimba
0  g4  1    0.64
1  c5  1    0.68
2  e5  2    0.72
4  f5  1    0.68
5  d5  1    0.64
